('F-HIST-20260714-CASTLE-PADDING-COORDINATES','foundry.historical.legacy-implementation',NULL,'Castle teleport padding coordinate correction','apply_castle_scene_padding_to_teleports.mjs shifted source and destination coordinates by round(scene.width*padding), round(scene.height*padding), then marked coordinateFrame=scene-padding-v1. Evidence that Scene padding changes the relevant coordinate frame.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260714-18-CASTLE-FOUNDRY-IMPLEMENTATION',NULL,'foundry scene padding coordinates'),
('F-HIST-20260714-CASTLE-KITCHEN-WALLS','foundry.historical.legacy-implementation',NULL,'Castle Kitchen historical wall set','patch_kitchen_walls.mjs defined eight line-segment Walls for Castle of Dreams - A1 - Kitchen, including one door wall, with movement/light/sight/sound restrictions. Direct LevelDB write is legacy; line-segment wall geometry remains historical evidence.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260714-18-CASTLE-FOUNDRY-IMPLEMENTATION',NULL,'foundry wall line door historical'),
('F-HIST-20260718-CASTLE-REGIONBEHAVIOR-TELEPORT','foundry.historical.regionbehavior',NULL,'Castle RegionBehavior teleport document pattern','castle-of-dreams-auto-wire-teleports.js paired reciprocal Region names and created/updated/deduplicated type=teleportToken RegionBehavior embedded documents with destination Region UUIDs, center placement, snap true, choice false, revealed true and transition duration.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260714-18-CASTLE-FOUNDRY-IMPLEMENTATION',NULL,'foundry RegionBehavior teleportToken'),
('F-HIST-20260625-ITEM-UUID-SCAN-1150','foundry.historical.data-extraction',NULL,'Historical Foundry item UUID structured extraction','A historical extraction summary recorded 1,150 compendium-item UUID rows and explicitly noted binary scanning was not a completeness guarantee.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260625-FOUNDRY-ITEM-UUID-EXTRACTION',NULL,'foundry item uuid corpus'),
('F-HIST-20260625-ITEM-UUID-LEVELDB-107335','foundry.historical.data-extraction',NULL,'Historical Foundry LevelDB item UUID corpus','The LevelDB summary reports 255 databases and 107,335 item UUID rows: 58,205 world-item, 49,129 compendium-item, 1 actor-embedded-item; Ballad of Chauser Bill contributed 27,643. Historical corpus evidence, not current completeness proof.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260625-FOUNDRY-ITEM-UUID-EXTRACTION',NULL,'foundry item uuid leveldb corpus'),
('F-HIST-20260625-INTO-FEYWILD-ITEM-TYPES','foundry.historical.data-extraction',NULL,'Into the Feywild historical item-type distribution','Historical extraction recorded 17,794 UUID rows: 6,012 compendium and 11,782 world; types included spell 4,442, equipment 4,269, weapon 3,741, base 2,230, consumable 1,310, loot 555, container 437, tool 320, feat 296, Item 128, enchantment 66.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260625-FOUNDRY-ITEM-UUID-EXTRACTION',NULL,'foundry dnd5e item types corpus'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-REFERENCE-ENV','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'DMF historical reference environment','DMF guide records Foundry v14.364, DND5e 5.3.3, Midi-QOL 14.0.9, DAE 14.0.12 and Item Macro 3.0.1 for Into the Feywild; historical exact-stack only.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-NATIVE-FIRST','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'DMF native-first tested item-authoring rule','DMF records core DND5e activities, uses and Active Effects as the most reliable tested approach before module-specific automation.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-ACTIVITY-ID-16','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'DND5e activity IDs tested at 16 alphanumeric characters','DMF records DND5e v5.3.3 activity _id values must be exactly 16 alphanumeric characters; this fixed a 15-character Dewdrop Vial validation failure.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-ITEM-FOLDER','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'Item.create folder placement historical test','DMF testing recorded folder: folder.id inside Item.create data worked; relying on {folder: folder.id} as the second argument produced an empty folder and root item in that tested stack.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-NATIVE-ENCHANT','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'Native DND5e enchant activity historical proof','DMF recorded a working native enchant activity using CONFIG.DND5E.activityTypes.enchant.documentClass plus an embedded ActiveEffect type=enchantment.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-NATIVE-SUMMON','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'Native DND5e summon activity historical proof','DMF recorded working native summon activities using CONFIG.DND5E.activityTypes.summon.documentClass with Actor UUID profiles; Wolfcall Charm and Catguard Plate were reported working.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-MULTIPROFILE-SUMMON','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'Native multi-profile summon historical proof','DMF recorded one native summon activity with multiple profiles displaying a selection dropdown; profiles had separate 16-character IDs and Actor UUIDs.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-EQUIPMENT-ATTACK','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'Equipment attack activity historical proof','DMF recorded a non-weapon equipment attack from CONFIG.DND5E.activityTypes.attack.documentClass; Helm of the Psimaster attack plus summon workflow was reported fully successful.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-DIRECT-TOKEN-LIGHT','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'Direct token light update replaced ATL historical failure','DMF records ATL.light.* Active Effect keys failed for the tested toggle; direct TokenDocument light updates with prior state stored in token flags were reliable.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-2-21-7-LIVE','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'DMF 2.21.7 live Foundry verification','DMF status records 2.21.7 installed, Items shortcuts and Forge Settings/panes visible after reload, saved endpoint/model/token surviving full Foundry reload, and live provider connection behavior.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-DIAGNOSTICS-6OF6','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'DMF non-destructive diagnostics 6/6','DMF status records built-in diagnostics passing 6/6 in DMF Test World without creating documents; earlier v2.16 verification likewise reported 6/6 without world-document creation.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical'),
('F-HIST-20260701-DMF-DND5E-RESOLVER','foundry.historical.dmf',NULL,'DMF read-only DND5e content resolver','DMF 2.19.0 added read-only exact-name Spell/Equipment lookup returning source UUID provenance and compatibility details without importing or mutating compendium documents.','historical','historical','locked','S-HIST-20260701-DMF-FOUNDRY-EVIDENCE',NULL,'foundry dnd5e DMF tested historical');

